<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-331436-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-331436-1')">1</a>. Well, technically the foundation isn't a goi but i'm gonna keep using that for shortness</div>
</div>

